            "text": "Right atrium ← deoxygenated blood from body. Right ventricle → lungs (pulmonary artery). Left atrium ← oxygenated blood from lungs. Left ventricle → body (aorta). Four valves (tricuspid, pulmonary, mitral, aortic) prevent backflow."
