          "solution": "Max strain = ΔL/L = 0.2/2000 = 0.0001. Max stress = E × strain = 200 × 10⁹ × 0.0001 = 2 × 10⁷ Pa = 20 MPa. Area needed A = F/stress = 8000 / (2 × 10⁷) = 4 × 10⁻⁴ m². For circular: πr² = 4 × 10⁻⁴, so r ≈ 0.0113 m = 11.3 mm. Diameter ≈ 22.6 mm or about 0.9 inches."
