        "storyContext": "Arjun says: What's 1/2 of 2/3 of a chocolate bar? Priya multiplies: 1/2 x 2/3: multiply tops and bottoms. (1x2)/(2x3) = 2/6 = 1/3. She shades a bar to show. Yes, exactly 1/3 of a bar!",
