          "solution": "Step 1: HAND SORTING (or sieving with different mesh sizes) separates whole spices from powder. Step 2: Add water to dissolve sugar. FILTRATION separates sugar solution from tea powder solids. Step 3: EVAPORATION of sugar solution recovers sugar crystals. Step 4: TEA POWDER can be dried and stored. Result: Each component pure and separated."
