            "label": "Definition",
            "text": "Food security = all people have enough safe, nutritious food for active, healthy life. Four dimensions: (1) Availability (enough production), (2) Access (afford/get food), (3) Stability (consistent supply, no shocks), (4) Utilization (proper nutrition, sanitation, health)."
